            <ArticleTitle>Chondroblastoma of the patella presenting as knee pain in an adolescent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of chondroblastoma of the patella, associated with an aneurysmal bone cyst and pathologic fracture, that presented as knee pain in a 13-year-old girl. This case is the fifth case in the literature that associates patellar chondroblastoma with fracture, which should probably be regarded as a significant feature of this lesion.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
